{"id":"5c9ac9c993a94d32","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-prob3-markov-kernel.md","title":"ZFC Prob3 Markov Kernel","display":"df-zfc-prob3-markov-kernel — ZFC Prob3 Markov Kernel","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob3-markov-kernel","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob3-markov-kernel"],"display":"df-zfc-prob3-markov-kernel — ZFC Prob3 Markov Kernel","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob3-markov-kernel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob3-markov-kernel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob3-markov-kernel — ZFC Prob3 Markov Kernel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,\\mathcal E,K,A,B,x,m,n,r\\in V\">\\(E,\\mathcal E,K,A,B,x,m,n,r\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3MarkovKernel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3MarkovKernel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_+\\coloneqq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(E_+\\coloneqq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\\notin\\mathbb R\">\\(\\infty\\notin\\mathbb R\\)</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_+\">\\(E_+\\)</span> 上，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\leq b\\leftrightarrow(b=\\infty\\lor(a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land a\\leq_{\\mathbb R}b))\">\\(a\\leq b\\leftrightarrow(b=\\infty\\lor(a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land a\\leq_{\\mathbb R}b))\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\oplus b\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a+_{\\mathbb R}b,&amp;a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\\\\\infty,&amp;a=\\infty\\lor b=\\infty.\\end{cases}\">\\(a\\oplus b\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a+_{\\mathbb R}b,&amp;a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\\\\\infty,&amp;a=\\infty\\lor b=\\infty.\\end{cases}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in E_+^\\omega\">\\(u\\in E_+^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_u\">\\(p_u\\)</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(p_u,\\omega,E_+)\\land p_u(0)=0\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(n+1)=p_u(n)\\oplus u(n))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(p_u,\\omega,E_+)\\land p_u(0)=0\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(n+1)=p_u(n)\\oplus u(n))\\)</span> 的唯一函数图。可数和是下式唯一确定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}u(n)=r\\leftrightarrow r\\in E_+\\land[\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq r)]\\land\\forall b\\in E_+\\;([\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq b)]\\to r\\leq b)\">\\(\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}u(n)=r\\leftrightarrow r\\in E_+\\land[\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq r)]\\land\\forall b\\in E_+\\;([\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq b)]\\to r\\leq b)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}t(n)\">\\(\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}t(n)\\)</span> 使用函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle n,t(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle n,t(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>；只在各项属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_+\">\\(E_+\\)</span> 时使用。函数图及自然数分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>；本约定展开 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a> 的非负部分和约定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}markov\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb3MarkovKernel}_S(E,\\mathcal E,K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal E,E)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(K,E\\times\\mathcal E,[0,1])\n\\land\\forall x\\in E\\;\\Biggl(\nK(\\langle x,\\varnothing\\rangle)=0\n\\land K(\\langle x,E\\rangle)=1\n\\land\\forall A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to A(m)\\cap A(n)=\\varnothing)\n\\to K\\!\\left(\\left\\langle x,\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A(n)\\right\\rangle\\right)\n=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}K(\\langle x,A(n)\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\Biggr)\n\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal E\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\bigl(\\{x\\in E:K(\\langle x,B\\rangle)&gt;r\\}\\in\\mathcal E\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}markov\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb3MarkovKernel}_S(E,\\mathcal E,K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal E,E)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(K,E\\times\\mathcal E,[0,1])\n\\land\\forall x\\in E\\;\\Biggl(\nK(\\langle x,\\varnothing\\rangle)=0\n\\land K(\\langle x,E\\rangle)=1\n\\land\\forall A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to A(m)\\cap A(n)=\\varnothing)\n\\to K\\!\\left(\\left\\langle x,\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A(n)\\right\\rangle\\right)\n=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}K(\\langle x,A(n)\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\Biggr)\n\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal E\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\bigl(\\{x\\in E:K(\\langle x,B\\rangle)&gt;r\\}\\in\\mathcal E\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For each state <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>, the section <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\mapsto K(\\langle x,B\\rangle)\">\\(B\\mapsto K(\\langle x,B\\rangle)\\)</span> is a probability measure.</li>\n<li>For each measurable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>, the evaluation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto K(\\langle x,B\\rangle)\">\\(x\\mapsto K(\\langle x,B\\rangle)\\)</span> is measurable, expressed by rational superlevel sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"